## Test contract added

The test asserts the input set first: at least one app manifest declares `next`, and the lockfile holds at least one `next` package key (A4). It then requires every declared range floor and every locked `next` version to be 16.4.5 or later. A synthetic fixture proves the boundary (16.4.4 fails, 16.4.5 passes) and the A4 empty-set paths. No hash is used.

